00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.450 size:81% position:41%
-There´s Mark Ruffalo.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Marissa Tomei.
-Marissa Tomei.

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:53.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Fisher Stevens.
-Fisher Stevens.

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:54.754 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:57.123 size:88% position:44%
How much do you think --

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
